{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_03_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_03",
  "title": "自由射手",
  "storyCode": "LE-3",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "44282cb9cb41583c13ade334bb67df45e64e0e7715084934fafe55a6766b99ca",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看......沒錯，就是這家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼豪華，真的是樂器店嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，這是全維謝海姆最好的樂器商店，要不然我也不會帶你來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我來高庭區根本沒申請......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那幫官僚效率低得很，等他們看到你的申請，音樂會都結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，就算被發現了，不也就是罰款嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說，要是有人協助感染者離開夕照區，對這個人的處罰比對感染者本人更重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕什麼，沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把腰挺直了，別畏縮，要是被看出來也很麻煩的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生您好，請問您是要挑選樂器，還是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，我們來選購一把大提琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知這位先生是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？他是我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生，雖然失禮，但我得提醒您，衣著不整的人是禁止入店的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我還是在外面等著......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在外面？您這樣鬼鬼祟祟，到底在害怕什麼？您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道自己在懷疑誰嗎？衣著不整、鬼鬼祟祟......竟敢這樣形容一位貴族，是不是不想在這幹下去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他現在只是一時困窘，不得已穿得樸素些，衣著既無髒汙又無缺損，你憑什麼不讓他入店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請恕我失言，可這位先生的穿著，與本店的整體格調......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格調？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這位——堂兄弟，剛剛遭了很大的變故，視若珍寶的大提琴也在動盪中遭到破壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正想帶他來買把新琴，略表慰問之意，哪輪得到你來妄談什麼格調？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對此感到十分痛心，但衣著不整之人禁止入內，這也是我們的規定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，我不能讓您的這位同伴入店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑鍵把自己的斗篷脫了下來，直接披在白堊身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在他和我穿了一樣的衣服，他能不能進？還是說，我這件斗篷也算衣著不整的一部分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我一會兒再穿上這件斗篷，是不是連我都不能進了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我去問下店長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個看人下菜碟的傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的外套，給你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從一開始就是我答應要給你買琴，也是我把你拉過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算跟那個人打一架，我也得把你帶進這家店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬分抱歉，本店向兩位致以誠摯的歉意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "資歷尚淺的店員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "店長馬上就來，他將親自為兩位介紹本店的樂器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，請問您現在有時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是芙蓉呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "和善的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_497_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於您的病情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g1_gorgeousstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真怕剛才那個店員突然報告治安官......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會呢，他又不知道你是感染者，只不過看你穿得窮酸，把你當成一般的平民——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，我們忘了一樣東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演出服啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可不能穿這身衣服上台演出，太不正式了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我給你找全維謝海姆最好的裁縫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，量體型的時候，源石結晶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就——找夕照區最好的裁縫，怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g7_concerthall_outside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天空湛藍晴朗......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，好啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還是要謝謝你，謝謝你給我買這把琴，謝謝你幫我訂做衣服！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大提琴也就算了，衣服還沒拿到手呢，也不知道你穿起來是什麼樣的，不用忙著謝我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天下午就知道了！一定會很合身的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從樂器店出來開始，你除了哼歌就是道謝，已經謝了我十幾次啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "河水潺潺流淌......♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這曲子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像聽過，又好像沒聽過......沒什麼，可能是我弄錯了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，既然你學過大提琴，為什麼自己沒有琴呢？壞了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "教我大提琴的老師確實送過我一把琴，但很快就被人弄壞了，雖然現在還放在家裡，但恐怕......離開這座城市的時候，只能帶著琴弓走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "琴弓？只留著琴弓，能有什麼用？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要看到琴弓，我就能想起老師的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是連琴弓也沒了，我怕我會把老師忘掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘掉？可你現在不是好好記著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實已經開始忘了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師是個頭髮很長的薩科塔大姐姐，穿的衣服很素淨，嘴上總是有笑意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以前能記住更多的，彷彿老師就站在我的眼前......現在不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我曾經想記住很多人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我需要一些紀念，保證我不會忘光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......紀念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那這次呢？你打算拿什麼紀念車爾尼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請他給我簽個名就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島的芙蓉呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉的話，或許可以找她要一個帶羅德島標誌的空藥瓶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗，這也太隨便了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要能讓我想起來就好，形式不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我呢？就是這把大提琴了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是別吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師送我的大提琴很快就壞了，假如這一把也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想留一枚你送我的硬幣，鑽個孔，做個小小的掛墜，應該挺不錯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "紀念我的怎麼是錢啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，不行嗎？那我換一個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用、不用，也挺好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們現在就回家練習？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我想......我們先去車爾尼先生家一趟吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "免了，他一看見我就來氣，我又不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是誤會而已，會解開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從我們第一天遇見他，你就在說我和他有誤會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算真有誤會，我覺得也已經解不開了，還是算了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天車爾尼先生不也認可過你了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誤會都是一點一點解開的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我也想找車爾尼先生試試你給我買的琴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼好的琴，如果沒有懂行的聽眾，那也太可惜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，請問您有時間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遲疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉？不好意思，我不是很有空......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您只需要回答幾個問題就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果其中有您不願意回答的，您也可以選擇不回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遲疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不抽我的血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒得到您的允許，我是不會那麼做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遲疑的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g5_czernyhome"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我個人不是很想承認，但這樣的琴可不是你們一上午就能在夕照區淘到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們去高庭區了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "膽子不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實......為了讓我進店，黑鍵還和樂器店的店員吵了一架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吵架？他還嫌你這身衣服在高庭區不夠顯眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個店員說是“衣著不整不得入店”，可白堊這身衣服哪裡不整了？他們無非是看白堊一身平民的衣服，故意找碴罷了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一個貴族，倒開始為平民打抱不平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是為白堊打抱不平！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不論到底是貴族還是平民，他的水準完全配得上那家店裡的樂器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不讓白堊進店，反而把精品賣給那些空有花架子的貴族，簡直就是把上好的木料當柴火燒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難為你能說出這樣的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "白堊，你去熟悉一下新琴吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "車爾尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4047_pianst_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我給黑鍵伴奏，讓他單獨練一會兒，看看能不能改一改他的習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑鍵",
      "speakerId": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "改一改我的習慣......這個，我還是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，車爾尼先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）你看，誤會是會一點一點解除的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白堊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_482_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）車爾尼先生的態度已經在轉變了，現在就看你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "28_g2_slumstreets"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魔族佬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕緊滾，你還沒長記性嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，打擾您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你給我回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您還有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你肯定又想回你那辦事處躲著去吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼做多少有點過火了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你算哪根蔥——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可還欠著我不少咖啡錢呢，你覺得我算哪根蔥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，原來是別格勒店長......不好意思，我剛剛沒注意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕照區畢竟是感染者聚居區，雖然很有活力，可蠻不講理的人也不少，你最好還是小心一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多謝您的提醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我的名片，上面有我咖啡店的電話，想喝了可以打給我，我們的外送服務很快的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說起來，羅德島辦事處之前不一直是行板在打理嗎，你是剛調派到這裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我其實是來調查這裡的異常現象的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，別格勒先生，您的病情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "別格勒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_485_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "異常現象？什麼異常現象，我完全不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "狀況如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉赫曼的行動很成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "烏提卡伯爵大體按照預期行動，雖然對拉赫曼造成了一定的妨礙，但他應該是無心的，也沒引發什麼後果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這沒什麼。我本來也不指望靠一個拉赫曼就把羅德島的人趕出夕照區。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於車爾尼，為了請那些眼高於頂的評論家出席音樂會，他幾乎把以前的人情全用了，還搭了不少版權進去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有消息說，他捏著鼻子，給自己以前很看不起的一個貴族的曲集寫了推薦文章......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對他而言，做到這種程度，已經不可能回頭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前幾天那個薩科塔呢？我記得她入城申報的時候說自己是從拉特蘭來萊塔尼亞采風的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照記錄，她已經結束了在維謝海姆的遊覽，在今天早些時候離開了維謝海姆，前往下一個目的地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她的事就不用管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格特魯德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我們該去夕照廳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "輕浮的貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_492_1",
      "isRemote": false,
